<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-06T08:05:45.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 08:05:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi officials and US officials met to discuss regional security while Iraq reinforced its western desert defenses and declared readiness for a nuclear emergency with limited fallout risk. Iranian forces continued attacks on Kurdish opposition, including a missile found on an old drone that was defused in Kirkuk, and a militia leader publicly criticized Iraq's stance on the Iran blockade. A security guard was killed and three people injured in a shooting at an oilfield near Kirkuk. NATO held a high-level political dialogue with Iraqi officials. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQMVBBOE1vYThfaERwMm5SalVMTXQzR3NWZm9qMVlPWWJUY0JWeWRqRjBLa3NCZlBaNU9YQzM4SEh4aDNhdUtCcTBMZzdnVDhlMGx0R2FkLV9MbnZsUDRRQm9Zc1NfbVQ0V0ZRNHpTZjB1UlpGcld6S3FCeVBjVEhOczhiNUJhRWFmSlJ1cg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQTXI2a2hBdVVpSUVUUlRndlN3YkdJVzFaNnNUcUJCTXBCaEZCdVdpX1JBTWhwQlExcG96bTMtV2xnS2JEaU5ZekNTSDhLbkcyZ254UnBaTklZa0tJLVZVUHpYVmJGQm5wUDBiRUF2bHdESXdwT0VGbXEzcTY4SDJBanZVVHlybXNZVUFtNGt4cXRRZWJBdVg0RGdkMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Press Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOTzVCSVRYTmczeFRjbWVEaGJJQXZ2ZDhnSlNoZS1qQy10SXAyb2g3QUx6d05XOFVGLWpaVDFBQW94M1ZDWHdreVVLeFJDb2VkNDFsdUhwc0RybF9FR0RMUEo4V2cxdE1CcVJnMDRkVGdsRGQ1bWtfUHZQVVRhMDRBYnc1eHZ3QUkyZXdLMw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Amwaj.media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPMjczaENXMkRKc05FOGlHeGg2dExGc0F1VjRianRoWjNnWTFVaGt4MWs1ZUFtRkJMY1VscFFHM2dobWNHU0YwVjFKMEFxYV